   "description": "The way to the ponds from Rogaška Slatina: in Tekačevo we turn right off the main road (after the inn and railway crossing). We drive for two hundred meters and then, at the wooden signpost showing the pond, we turn left to the macadam road that we follow for another hundred meters and we have arrived. We leave the car at the edge of the lower pond."
